<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<FinalDraft DocumentType="Script" Template="No" Version="1"><Content><Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" Number="1"><Text>EXT. 归来客栈门前 - 夜</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>暴雨砸在一顶红喜轿上。四名轿夫停在客栈檐下，没有唢呐，没有宾客。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>卢青禾拨亮灯笼。二十七岁，袖口束紧，腰间算盘比佩刀更顺手。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>她低头看鞋：轿夫靴底黏着北岭红泥。新郎霍三的黑靴上，是南渡口的芦苇籽。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>霍三</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>新娘染了风寒。包店，四十九两。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>他把银袋砸上柜台。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>卢青禾称银，珠子一拨到底。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>卢青禾</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>酒饭十二两，房钱三十两，封口钱六两。四十八。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>霍三</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>多的一两，赏你。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>卢青禾把一锭碎银单独压在砚台下。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>卢青禾</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>我不收来路不明的赏钱。账不平，门不开。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>喜轿里，一只女人的手悄悄攥紧。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" Number="2"><Text>INT. 归来客栈大堂 - 稍后</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>门窗落闩。迎亲队占住四角。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>角落里，裴渡把斗笠压得很低。他腰间挂着一块被刮去官纹的旧捕牌。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>卢青禾端茶经过。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>卢青禾</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>住店还是躲债？</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>裴渡</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>二者价钱不同？</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>卢青禾</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>住店二十文。躲债，先看债主带几把刀。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>楼上传来一下铜铃。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>所有人抬头。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>霍三的笑消失了。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" Number="3"><Text>INT. 二楼新房 - 连续</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>卢青禾撞开门。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>红烛，血泊，一只绣鞋。后窗大开，雨往屋里打。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>窗外是光滑泥地，没有脚印。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>霍三拔刀，抵住裴渡的喉咙。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>霍三</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>房里少了新娘，多了个前捕快。好算。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>裴渡从床底挑起一根透明鱼线。线头系着铜铃。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>他蘸血，闻了闻。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>裴渡</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>猪血。加盐，才肯流这么久。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>卢青禾掰开绣鞋后跟。一张当票掉出来：四十八两。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>票背盖着“卢九章”的旧印。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>她的呼吸停了一拍。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>卢青禾落下门闩，把钥匙吞进嘴里。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>卢青禾</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>这一两的来路查清楚以前——谁也别想走。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Transition"><Text>切黑。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" Number="4"><Text>INT. 二楼走廊 - 夜</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>霍三的人逐间搜房。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>卢青禾趴在地上，看鱼线拖过积水留下的细痕。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>裴渡</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>你吞钥匙的本事，跟谁学的？</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>卢青禾张嘴，吐出藏在舌下的钥匙。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>卢青禾</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>跟不交房钱的客人。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>线痕一直通向后院。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" Number="5"><Text>EXT. 后院水井 - 夜</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>井绳湿透。裴渡放下灯笼，光停在井壁半腰。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>一只手从废弃藏冰洞伸出，抓住灯笼。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>燕双爬出来。她撕掉新娘红妆，脸上有一道新鲜掌印。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>卢青禾</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>猪血，鱼线，假脚印。你把自己的丧事办得挺省。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>燕双</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>不死一次，逃不出他们的婚书。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>她解开腰带，里面缝着十二张不同姓名的婚契。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>院门外响起刀鞘碰撞声。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" Number="6"><Text>INT. 客栈灶房 - 片刻后</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>燕双躲进柴柜。卢青禾把四十九两银子倒进面粉缸。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>她逐锭检查，在那枚多出的一两上摸到一道十字刻痕。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>霍三踹门而入。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>霍三</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>掌柜，新娘在哪？</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>卢青禾举起刻痕银。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>卢青禾</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>先说这枚银子从哪来。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>霍三第一次失去笑意。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>柴柜里，燕双捂住嘴。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>霍三一步步逼近。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>霍三</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>你爹当年，就是因为太会算账才死。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>卢青禾把银子丢进灶火。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>银壳在火中“啪”地裂开。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>一卷薄纸滚出。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Transition"><Text>切黑。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" Number="7"><Text>INT. 客栈灶房 - 连续</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>裴渡扑灭灶火，抢起薄纸。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>上面密密写着姓名缩写、日期和银两。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>裴渡</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>不是账。是失踪的人。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>燕双从柴柜出来。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>燕双</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>迎亲队每过一县，就换一张婚书。到了南渡口，人上船，名字下账。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>卢青禾看向裴渡。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>卢青禾</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>你认得这种记法。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>裴渡没有否认。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" Number="8"><Text>INT. 客栈账房 - 夜</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>门外，霍三命人泼油。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>裴渡取出刮花的捕牌。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>裴渡</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>七年前，我奉命抄过你父亲的赈银账。他在每一页都少记一两。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>卢青禾</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>后来呢？</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>裴渡</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>我把账交给上司。我以为——</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>裴渡从靴底夹层抽出半页焦黑的拓本。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>裴渡</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>剩下半页送到了巡按手里。他就在山下，只缺罗敬亲口认这笔账。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>卢青禾一巴掌扇过去。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>卢青禾</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>“我以为”三个字，不入账。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>外面的火把照亮窗纸。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>燕双</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>名单给我。我去引开他们。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>卢青禾把薄纸塞进口中，咽下。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" Number="9"><Text>EXT. 客栈后院 - 连续</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>卢青禾独自推门出去。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>霍三的刀架到她肩上。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>卢青禾</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>一两银子在我肚子里。杀她没用。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>霍三盯着她的喉咙。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>霍三</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>剖开，也不费事。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>卢青禾笑，嘴角沾着一点纸屑。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>卢青禾</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>那你最好找个会算账的大夫。少一寸，名单就不全。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>霍三抬刀。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>裴渡从屋顶落下，扑倒霍三。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>混战中，卢青禾退回账房。她掀开算盘背板——真正的薄纸藏在珠轴之间。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>门外传来整齐的官靴声。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>一个温和的男声响起。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>罗敬（画外）</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>县衙查案。所有人，放下兵器。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>卢青禾看见窗纸上官帽的影子，脸色比见霍三更冷。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Transition"><Text>切黑。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" Number="10"><Text>INT. 客栈大堂 - 黎明前</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>主簿罗敬坐上主位，白净、从容。霍三跪在一旁，却没有被上枷。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>裴渡双手被缚。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>罗敬</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>裴捕快，停职七年还查案，算渎职还是念旧？</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>裴渡</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>看主簿大人想把我写进哪本账。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>罗敬转向卢青禾，推来一张认罪状。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>罗敬</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>交出你父亲藏的东西。旧案可改判，他也能有个清白牌位。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>卢青禾提笔，却在纸上打了一把叉。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>卢青禾</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>死人要牌位，活人要出口。燕双先走。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" Number="11"><Text>INT. 客栈酒窖 - 片刻后</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>官差押卢青禾取“证据”。燕双藏在酒缸后。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>卢青禾故意摔碎一坛酒。酒液漫过地砖，显出一排旧墨字：丙、丁、己，旁边都少一个“一”。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>燕双</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>什么意思？</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>卢青禾</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>我爹没有算错。他故意让总数少一两。重抄的人会把账做平，原账才会留着缺口。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>她撬起砖，下面只有半枚烧焦的账册封皮。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>裴渡曾说账册被毁。他漏说了，毁在这间客栈。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" Number="12"><Text>INT. 客栈大堂 - 连续</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>卢青禾把烧焦封皮摔到裴渡面前。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>卢青禾</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>你来过。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>裴渡</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>我来晚了。火是罗敬放的。我拿走半页，想等能扳倒他的人。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>卢青禾</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>等了七年？</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>裴渡低下头。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>罗敬抬手。官差给裴渡套上重枷。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>罗敬</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>现在，能扳倒我的人也齐了。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>燕双忽然戴着红盖头走下楼。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>燕双</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>大人，我愿跟霍三走。条件是——重办喜宴，当众交货。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>卢青禾看着她，立刻明白。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>卢青禾</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>喜宴的钱，先付。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>她把那枚裂开的空银壳放到罗敬面前。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Transition"><Text>切黑。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" Number="13"><Text>INT. 客栈大堂 - 白天</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>红绸重新挂起。卢青禾给每张桌子摆一枚带十字刻痕的一两银子。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>来客不是亲朋，是十二名失踪女子的家人。他们沉默坐下，各自握着当票、婚书或牙行收据。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>罗敬站在二楼，看见他们。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>罗敬</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>谁准这些人进来？</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>卢青禾</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>办喜宴，自然请娘家人。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>霍三按住刀。罗敬示意他忍。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" Number="14"><Text>INT. 客栈柴房 - 同时</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>裴渡戴着木枷。燕双用发簪撬锁。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>裴渡</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>你真打算上那顶轿？</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>燕双</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>我上过三次。第一次被骗，第二次逃，第三次——送他们上路。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>锁开了。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>她把一张巡按密令塞给裴渡。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>燕双</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>你的援兵只敢在门外等证据。那就让证据自己喊。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" Number="15"><Text>INT. 客栈大堂 - 黄昏</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>喜宴开席。燕双盖着红盖头坐在中央。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>卢青禾抱出总账。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>卢青禾</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>丙字号新妇，身价四十，船钱六，过桥——</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>她故意停住，把算盘拨成四十五。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>卢青禾</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>合计四十五两。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>罗敬脱口而出。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>罗敬</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>四十六。你漏了那一两过桥钱。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>大堂死寂。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>卢青禾抬眼。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>卢青禾</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>我没说丙字号过哪座桥。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>十二桌客人同时举起手中的凭据。每张上面都有“丙、丁、己”的暗号。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>裴渡撞开柴房门。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>罗敬掀翻烛台。火沿地上的酒一路窜向账桌。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Transition"><Text>切黑。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" Number="16"><Text>INT. 客栈大堂 - 连续</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>火墙隔开众人。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>霍三抢走总账，扔进火中。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>罗敬</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>账没了。你们只是一群串供的刁民。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>卢青禾没有扑向火。她冲到窗边，推开全部木窗。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>卢青禾</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>念账！</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>第一桌的老妇站起来。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>老妇</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>元和十六年三月，我女儿杏儿，婚书收银四十六两。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>第二桌的男人站起。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>男人</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>元和十六年五月，我妹妹阿萍，南渡口船票一张。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>一个接一个，声音穿过窗户。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" Number="17"><Text>EXT. 归来客栈门前 - 连续</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>门外挤满百姓。巡按御史和书记官在人群中记录。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>每念一个名字，就有人把一枚刻痕银投进铜盆。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>叮。叮。叮。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>裴渡把木枷卡进霍三的刀路，燕双从喜轿底抽出藏好的铁链，缠住霍三双腿。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>霍三倒地。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>罗敬冲向后门。卢青禾一脚踢翻算盘，满地算珠让他滑倒。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>裴渡按住罗敬。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>裴渡</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>罗主簿，这回给你一间不漏雨的牢房。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" Number="18"><Text>INT. 归来客栈大堂 - 数月后 - 日</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>修好的木窗敞着。门边新牌写着：女子独行，免费住三夜。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>燕双背着包袱离开。她把压柜的一两银放回柜台。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>燕双</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>账平了。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>卢青禾</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>你的平了。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>裴渡系着围裙，端来一摞没洗干净的碗。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>裴渡</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>巡按批了我的复职。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>卢青禾翻开账本。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>特写——裴渡名下：欠工钱一两。利息，每日一顿饭。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>裴渡</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>我什么时候欠的？</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>卢青禾</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>从你打碎第三只碗开始。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>裴渡看向水槽。里面只有两只碎碗。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>卢青禾把一只完整的碗推下柜台。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>裴渡飞身接住。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>卢青禾终于笑了。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>卢青禾</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>现在三只。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>门外，铜盆里那一两一两的银子，被阳光照亮。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Transition"><Text>淡出。</Text></Paragraph></Content><TitlePage><Content><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>一两银子的谋杀</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>古装悬疑轻喜短剧改编剧本</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>StoryForge 社区样片</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>StoryForge Showcase · 2026</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>网站展示终稿</Text></Paragraph></Content></TitlePage></FinalDraft>
